estion_id":"85348583-4bfe-4a04-8e0f-900d239da642","revision":"sha256:e7094478d4b173716121590576d3103611f53ae7df28818961a3f6d6c5804784","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"血压描述统计: 10名受试者舒张压: 72,75,78,70,76,79,73,75,77,74, 计算均数, 中位数, 标准差, 极差, 判定数据类型(6分)"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"Σx=749, 均数74.9, 中位数75, 样本标准差=2.766867, 样本方差=7.655556, 极差79-70=9, 为连续定量数据. 原均数75.90及标准差2.98错误"}]}}},{"path":"versions/653e2ece-791b-4372-82fd-0352a1a31270/61816f75d5a0d8872e86f758f6583ed0bc7135732f1cbc0a37181b2dd0017e8f.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"653e2ece-791b-4372-82fd-0352a1a31270","revision":"sha256:61816f75d5a0d8872e86f758f6583ed0bc7135732f1cbc0a37181b2dd0017e8f","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"二项分布计算: 单次药物有效概率0.6, 独立试验15例, 求有效10例概率(4分)"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"X~Bin(15,0.6), P(X=10)=C(15,10)×0.6^10×0.4^5=0.18593784, 保留两位小数应为0.19"}]}}},{"path":"versions/216224ab-c5ab-4c27-8524-b59c655fb7fa/ffbe25cb82eecec1dbe6307694a4a4d955c836ba454d292a0324aa53104d943d.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"216224ab-c5ab-4c27-8524-b59c655fb7fa","revision":"sha256:ffbe25cb82eecec1dbe6307694a4a4d955c836ba454d292a0324aa53104d943d","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"单样本t检验: 健康舒张压标准75mmHg, α=0.05双侧, 检验本组舒张压是否与标准值存在差异(7分)\n本组数据(原卷第1题): 72,75,78,70,76,79,73,75,77,74"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"H0: μ=75, H1: μ≠75. 本组均数74.9, s=2.766867, t=(74.9-75)/(s/√10)=-0.114291, df=9, 双侧P=0.911516. 不拒绝H0, 证据不足以认为总体均数与75有差异, 不能断言无差异. 假定独立样本及近似正态总体"}]}}}]}